%% Fixhub architecture — renders at https://mermaid.live (kept in sync with docs/architecture.md)
flowchart LR
    GH[GitHub App<br/>issues:read contents:read<br/>PRs:write-scoped] --> GW[Event Gateway<br/>FastAPI /webhooks/github<br/>HMAC + idempotency]
    GW --> Q[Queue<br/>Redis / in-memory]
    Q --> ORCH[Orchestrator<br/>resumable state machine]
    ORCH --> AG[Agent Worker<br/>bounded LLM tool loop<br/>max 12 iters]
    AG --> SB[Sandbox<br/>Docker per task]
    SB --> V[Verification<br/>repro → regression FAIL→PASS<br/>suite + lint]
    V --> P[Proof of Fix]
    P --> POL[Policy Engine]
    POL --> PRP[PR Publisher<br/>VerifiedArtifact only]
    PRP --> GH
    RI[Repo Intel<br/>ast + regex index] <--> AG
    MEM[Engineering Memory<br/>7 types, STALE on change] <--> AG
